{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>深夜4時0分天文台發出強烈季候風信號。\n</p>\n<p>\n<p><br/>\n當強烈季候風信號生效時，市民應密切關注天氣報告及風向變化。由於建築物或地形可能加劇風力，居住在風勢較強的地區的居民應採取積極的防風措施，應將室外物品，如花盆、傘架或其他易被風吹倒的物件移入室內，並檢查家中的窗戶是否牢固關閉，以防強風對窗戶造成損害。從事水上運動或海上工作的人士應特別注意，避免在大風或大浪出現時進行活動，並應避開可能出現大浪或暗湧的區域。\n</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天氣</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b7%e7%83%88%e5%ad%a3%e5%80%99%e9%a2%a8%e4%bf%a1%e8%99%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">強烈季候風信號</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港天文台</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T20:40:36.790318+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T20:20:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:12:08.410720+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:24.318843+00:00","content_hash":"c2b48ec3b06a03fae4e1ae87c3c73a18f92e8d7f9fea3c6c884b0c87a86433fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}